          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.010:block:4",
          "start": 761
        },
        "quote": "(d) “Electric personal assistive mobility device” means a self-balancing two-nontandem-wheeled device, designed to transport only one person, with an electric propulsion system that limits the maximum speed of the device to 15 miles per hour.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
